  - m_Id: 2584982163456
    m_Localized: Select level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2684273922048
    m_Localized: Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3702901738991616
    m_Localized: Larry lives in the pond. You must get him here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3707133229690880
    m_Localized: Frog Larry got lost in the forest, help him find the way home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3707996111269888
    m_Localized: Instructions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3708267860226048
    m_Localized: Larry can eat the fly, but if he gets too close, the fly will fly
      away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4253799829630976
    m_Localized: "Instructions\t"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4423355699662848
    m_Localized: Larry can neither go through the plants nor jump over them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4425522963648512
    m_Localized: A stone blocks the way, Larry can only jump over it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4453472656265216
    m_Localized: Moves Larry one square ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4453884713078784
    m_Localized: Larry jumps two squares, he can also jump over a stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4454241006620672
    m_Localized: Turns Larry to the left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4454596520022016
    m_Localized: Turns Larry to the right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4455004286062592
    m_Localized: Larry shoots his tongue towards the next square, if there's a fly
      there, he will eat it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4455477919453184
    m_Localized: Open the menu, but be careful, it'll stop Larry!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4456020834357248
    m_Localized: Interrupts Larry's path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4456565007552512
    m_Localized: Speeds up the course of the path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4457388240375808
    m_Localized: Create a custom block that you can set the number of repetitions
      for. You can nest your block up to 3 times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4463259775242240
    m_Localized: Starts the execution of the command.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4464099063861248
    m_Localized: Slots for controlling Larry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4465377651298304
    m_Localized: Slots for creating your own block.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5056136318390272
    m_Localized: In this panel, there are elements you use to control the game. You
      need to drag these elements into the bottom panel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5094226667868160
    m_Localized: Panel for running commands and creating custom blocks. The first
      row is for commands, the second row is for block creation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6971001094115328
    m_Localized: 'Frog Larry: Homecoming'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12412603916718080
    m_Localized: Clicking on the right edge hides the panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12419523331330048
    m_Localized: Clicking on the top edge hides the panel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681389109248
    m_Localized: Help Larry get to the pond! Drag the Move block into the first slot
      below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052288
    m_Localized: Great! One Move = one tile. Larry needs two more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052289
    m_Localized: Ready? Press Play and watch Larry go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052291
    m_Localized: The path turns! Larry must turn at the corner. Put the Right block
      in the 3rd slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052292
    m_Localized: 'Now add Moves: 2 before the turn and 3 after it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052293
    m_Localized: A stone! Larry can hop over it with Jump. Put Jump in the 2nd slot,
      right before the stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052294
    m_Localized: A fly! Larry can eat it when he's right in front of it. Put Eat
      in the 3rd slot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052295
    m_Localized: This path is long! Put 3 Move blocks into the red row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052296
    m_Localized: Now press Repeat. The red row turns into a single block.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052297
    m_Localized: Use + to set how many times it repeats. You need 4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417134681431052298
    m_Localized: Great! Drag the repeater up into the main row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417139962521161728
    m_Localized: Add one Move before the Jump and one after it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417139962521161729
    m_Localized: 'Add Moves: 2 before Eat and 3 after it, all the way to the pond.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417139962521161730
    m_Localized: Almost! Larry needs exactly 3 Moves. Open the menu and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417139962521161731
    m_Localized: 'Larry must turn at the corner: 2 Moves, Right, 3 Moves. Open the
      menu and try again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417139962521161732
    m_Localized: 'Jump right before the stone: Move, Jump, Move. Open the menu and
      try again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417139962521161733
    m_Localized: Go to the fly with 2 Moves, Eat, then 3 Moves. Open the menu and
      try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417139962521161734
    m_Localized: A repeater with 3 Moves set to 4 walks 12 tiles, right to the pond.
      Open the menu and try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417159871087087616
    m_Localized: Frogs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417159871124836352
    m_Localized: Choose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 417159871124836353
    m_Localized: Selected
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
